  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Celebrating Build Success**\n\nI\'m thrilled! The build compiled without a hitch. Now, I\'m fully focused on crafting a stunning, design-led summary for the user. I\'m prioritizing outlining creative styling, user flow, interactive enhancements, and visuals in a way that\'s proportional, clean, and engaging.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have successfully built and verified the **Shadow Leveling & Hunter Interface** web application. \n\nHere is a conceptual and visual design summary of what has been implemented to match your screenshots:\n\n### \360\237\214\214 Visual Identity & Theme Alignment\nThe application adheres strictly to the **Shadow Leveling / Hunter System Spec (inspired by Solo Leveling)**:\n*   **The \"Abyssal\" Palette:** Modeled around high-contrast pitch blacks (`#0A0A0A`) with digital slate containers, vibrant primary cyan highlighting borders for system elements, royal purples for legendary achievements, and emerald greens for stats and recovery indices.\n*   **Precision HUD Frame & Responsive Simulator:** In desktop browsers, the application renders inside a beautifully polished smartphone simulator (simulating mobile status bars, notch, battery percentage, cellular signal, and Wi-Fi configurations) directly matching the look of the React Native & Expo screenshots. On true mobile devices, it automatically scales to full-bleed smoothly.\n*   **Fine-Grained Aesthetics:** Implemented rolling transparent scanlines, corner chamfer frames, glowing emissive glass-morphic cards, and custom micro-vibrations for a highly premium, cinematic console interface feel.\n\n---\n\n### \360\237\225\271\357\270\217 Complete Interactive Screens\n\n1.  **Authorization Onboarding (\"Hunter Evaluation\" Screen):**\n    *   Designed after the initial signup screen with a matching scrolling anatomical body scan visualization, digital latency counts (`LATENCY: 12ms`), sensor calibrations (`E-RANK_PREDICTION: 98%`), and an interactive scan process ticker.\n    *   Registers data parameters such as identifier name, chrono age, mass, and custom objectives (e.g., *S-Rank Physique*, *Agility Peak*).\n2.  **Operational Command (\"Home View\" Screen):**\n    *   Centers the principal leveling progress charts with a shimmering animated bar showing experience values (`7,420 / 10,000 XP`).\n    *   Aligns state-driven panels displaying Rank rating badges (`E-Rank`), level numbers, and total calculated tactical combat power.\n    *   Tracks daily push-ups, sit-ups, and running distance parameters while featuring a real-time countdown timer that ticks down the hours, minutes, and seconds until the daily reset.\n3.  **Active Tactical Trails (\"Training Programs\" Carousel):**\n    *   Packs a dynamic list of custom programs, including premium trials like the *Adaptive Fighter Physique* (modeled on Garou\'s form) and the standard *Basic Daily Quest* (reflecting Saitama\'s routine).\n    *   Selecting a training card instantly swaps out the active quest metrics and transitions to the tracker command deck.\n4.  **Log Tracker & Simulated Workouts (\"Quests\" Deck):**\n    *   A simulated workout logger deck where you can click buttons to record muscle reps (e.g., +10/20 push-ups, +1/2.5 km run).\n    *   Features a responsive sound synthesiser cue (Web Audio API) to click and record sets with cinematic sonic feedback!\n5.  **Tactical Statistics Room (\"Profile View\" Screen):**\n    *   Aligns Sinwoo\'s profile handles, S-Rank status badges, level gantry bars, and a 2x2 achievements grid (unlocked and locked states with theme-paired lighting borders).\n    *   Includes a dynamically morphing **SVG Radar Chart** plotting traits (STR, AGI, END, REC, DIS) that morphs on click as stats are leveled up!\n6.  **\"Quest Completed\" Celebration Overlay (Celebration Modal):**\n    *   When quest objectives are met, the screen drops into a dark cinematic overlay showing a bright glowing **QUEST COMPLETED** notice.\n    *   Includes ticking numeric animations counting reward points (`+0` counts up to `+500 XP`) and logs permanent stat enhancements (+1 Strength, +1 Agility), updating the master profile level.\n"
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 369140928
    }
